WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.211
Four learners chose mango, two chose orange and three chose banana.

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:07.188
Mango has the most votes, with four.

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:11.167
Orange has the fewest votes, with two.

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:16.297
Four plus two plus three equals nine votes altogether.
